<!--
  Small icon for the playback notification.

  Android draws a notification's small icon as a flat silhouette: every opaque
  pixel is painted in the system's tint and everything else is transparent, so
  the launcher icon would come out as a white blob. This is a single-colour
  music note shape, which is what that treatment expects.
-->
